title KEYBOARD view, JA layer composing "kanjihenkan": kana reading and the candidate strip (ADR-024 FR-746)
view keyboard
caps off
unicode linux
lang_ja 1
ja 1
step tap_lang
step tap_key K
step tap_key A
step tap_key N
step tap_key J
step tap_key I
step tap_key H
step tap_key E
step tap_key N
step tap_key K
step tap_key A
step tap_key N
